  "notes": "Event affects two units (Unit 1 and Unit 3) simultaneously via a single common-cause trigger in Unit 2 switchgear during refueling outage; per schema constraints only one Unit anchor node was created for docket 05000528 (Unit 1). Narrative block 8 (Previous Similar Events) is truncated/garbled in the source text ('Verde in the last three years.') with no LER number, plant, or title identifiable, so no stub LER/SIMILAR_TO edge was created per rule 9's requirement for a concrete LER key. EDG, SP pump, and AF pump systems are modeled both as INVOLVES (event-participating) and MITIGATED_BY (functioned as designed to limit consequence), since they actuated successfully rather than being pre-existing backups during an inoperability window."
